THE CONTRAST, registered. Two rivals for the term the ladder cannot name.
  TRAFFIC  the BLOCK_N dependence is bytes: a smaller N-tile re-reads more, so
           dR/dn scales with the measured per-M-tile time and the two BLOCK_N
           cells read different amounts. alpha_b is then itself a function of
           BLOCK_N and the three-term model can be repaired inside a byte count.
  TIME     the BLOCK_N dependence is schedule: the same bytes, moved less well.
           dR/dn is then IDENTICAL at both BLOCK_N and the three-term traffic
           model cannot contain the term at all, because alpha is measuring a
           schedule and not a byte ratio.

  denominator, read not typed: 4378.0 GB/s, 'triad' pattern, from measured_nvidia_h200.yaml
  one full weight stream = 2.8186 GB = 0.6438 ms at this card's own measured rate
  once-read activation share a/W = 0.0186 per M-tile. It is ADDITIVE in dR/dn, so it
  cancels in a DIFFERENCE and not in a ratio, and the line that stood here said it cancelled in
  the ratio: a right number with the wrong reason under it. It does not enter the discriminator
  either way. The TRAFFIC ratio is the two cells' measured times divided, which neither adds nor
  subtracts it, and under TIME it is the same term on both sides of a ratio of 1.000.

